  "guid": "com.sgtlaggy.itempropertybackport",
  "name": "Item Property Backport",
  "slug": "item-property-backport",
  "teaser": "Get live item stat/balance changes!",
  "thumbnail": "",
  "downloads": 5559,
  "favourites_count": 40,
  "description": "<h2>Updated: July 16 2026</h2>\n<p>To update, delete <code>db/items.json</code> and it will be re-downloaded.</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Properties</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Generic</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>CanSellOnRagfair    (BSG flea blacklist)</li>\n<li>ConflictingItems    (item incompatibility)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Weapons, mods</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accuracy</li>\n<li>Ergonomics</li>\n<li>Loudness</li>\n<li>Recoil</li>\n<li>Velocity</li>\n<li>CameraSnap</li>\n<li>CenterOfImpact</li>\n<li>DeviationCurve</li>\n<li>DeviationMax</li>\n<li>RecoilAngle</li>\n<li>RecolDispersion   (not misspelled)</li>\n<li>RecoilForceBack</li>\n<li>RecoilForceUp</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Magazines</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>CheckTimeModifier</li>\n<li>LoadUnloadModifier</li>\n<li>MalfunctionChance</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Ammo</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>AmmoAccr        (accuracy)</li>\n<li>AmmoRec         (recoil)</li>\n<li>ArmorDamage</li>\n<li>BallisticCoeficient</li>\n<li>BulletMassGram</li>\n<li>Damage</li>\n<li>DurabilityBurnModificator</li>\n<li>FragmentationChance</li>\n<li>HeatFactor</li>\n<li>HeavyBleedingDelta</li>\n<li>InitialSpeed</li>\n<li>LightBleedingDelta</li>\n<li>MalfFeedChance</li>\n<li>MalfMisfireChance</li>\n<li>PenetrationChanceObstacle</li>\n<li>PenetrationPower</li>\n<li>PenetrationPowerDiviation  (not misspelled)</li>\n<li>StackMaxSize</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Armor, rigs, helmets, glasses</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>ArmorClass</li>\n<li>ArmorColliders</li>\n<li>ArmorMaterial</li>\n<li>ArmorType</li>\n<li>BlindnessProtection</li>\n<li>BlocksEarpiece</li>\n<li>BluntThroughput</li>\n<li>DeafStrength</li>\n<li>Durability</li>\n<li>MousePenalty           (turn speed)</li>\n<li>RepairCost</li>\n<li>RicochetParams</li>\n<li>SpeedPenaltyPercent</li>\n<li>WeaponErgonomicPenalty</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Headphones</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>AmbientVolume</li>\n<li>CompressorAttack</li>\n<li>CompressorGain</li>\n<li>CompressorRelease</li>\n<li>CompressorThreshold</li>\n<li>RolloffMultiplier</li>\n<li>Distortion</li>\n<li>DryVolume</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Nightvision</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>DiffuseIntensity</li>\n<li>Intensity</li>\n<li>NoiseIntensity</li>\n<li>NoiseScale</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Keys</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>MaximumNumberOfUsages</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Meds</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>MedUseTime</li>\n<li>MaxHpResource</li>\n<li>EffectsDamage</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Food</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>MaxResource</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Meds, Food</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>EffectsHealth</li>\n<li>Buffs</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Config</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><code>ExcludeProperties</code>: Each property can be individually excluded. See Properties tab or the included <code>properties.md</code> file for a list of property names.</li>\n<li><code>IncludeItems</code>: Apply changes only to specified items. Ignores <code>ExcludeItems</code>.</li>\n<li><code>ExcludeItems</code>: Apply changes to all items except specified.</li>\n<li><code>AllPrices</code>: Update prices for all items</li>\n<li><code>UnblacklistedPrices</code>: Update prices only for items that are newly available on the flea market</li>\n<li><code>UpdateGunsmith</code>: Apply changes to Gunsmith tasks</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Use the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://db.sp-tarkov.com/search\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT Item Finder</a> to find item IDs for lists.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Compatibility</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Fully compatible with <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2512/wtt-content-backport\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT Content Backport</a></li>\n<li>Supercedes <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2668/attachmentbackport\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">RuKira’s AttachmentBackport</a></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Recommended Mods</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1131/live-flea-prices\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Live Flea Prices</a> can keep item prices up to date with live.</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1343/skipper\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Skipper</a> <em>may</em> be required to complete some Gunsmith or similar tasks.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Data Source</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Data is sourced from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://tarkov.dev/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">tarkov.dev</a>. I’ll do my best to keep the data up to date with notable changes, keep an eye on the date above. Feel free to comment if I’m over a week late to an update.</p></div></div></div>\n",
