      "version": "1.4.0",
      "description": "<p>Changed item file format, new data is no longer compatible with older mod versions.</p>\n<p>Added <code>RemoveAmmoboxFleaLimit</code> config setting. SPT limits ammo boxes to 0-3 offers while all other items are 7-30. Setting this option will remove the override so they match other items.</p>\n<p>Added support for food, meds, and armor properties:\nMedUseTime\nEffectsDamage\nEffectsHealth\nBuffs\nMaxHpResource (meds)\nMaxResource (food)\nArmorClass\nArmorColliders\nArmorMaterial\nArmorType\nDurability\nRepairCost\nRicochetParams</p>\n<p>Fixed <code>properties.md</code> typo (<code>WeaponErgonomicPenalty</code>) and missing properties (<code>DeafStrength</code>, <code>BlocksEarpiece</code>).</p>\n",
