      "version": "1.2.0",
      "description": "<p>Add a config option to modify Gunsmith quests to latest values so Skipper is not necessary, enabled by default.</p>\n<p>This also makes an attempt to change the values listed in the quest description by simple replacement, only tested English. Some text may be misleading or confusing depending on value changed like “must weigh no more than 0 kg,” just ignore that condition.</p>\n<p>Requires the new config file or just the new config value:</p>\n<pre><code>\"UpdateGunsmith\": true\n</code></pre>\n<p>Note: Quest data included at time of upload was written by hand using the Fandom wiki for reference as tarkov.dev quests have not been updated with the April 20th ergo/recoil rebalance.</p>\n",
