      "version": "1.1.0",
      "description": "<p>Refactored to support many new properties. See the mod description for a list of all currently known/supported properties.</p>\n<p>The config file has been changed with renamed keys that work largely the same, though excluding specific properties is now a list instead of simple toggles.</p>\n<p>A <code>properties.md</code> file is also now present in the mod folder for offline reference of properties if you wish to exclude them. This is the same list that is in the mod description and also includes short JSON examples for anyone not familiar.</p>\n<p>As the new properties include magazine check time and load/unload modifiers, it now provides all properties from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2668/attachmentbackport\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AttachmentBackport</a>.</p>\n",
